{
  "ticker": "MAHLIFE",
  "name": "Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited",
  "description": "Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the real estate and infrastructure development business in India. It engages in the construction, development, and sale of residential and commercial properties; project management; and rental of properties. The company also sells freshwater and treated sewage to industrial customers. In addition, it is involved in establishing, acquiring, developing, and maintaining industrial park, townships, special economic zones, technology parks, software parks, industrial areas, and industrial estates, for industries and software and other knowledge based units; and provision of infrastructural facilities for parks and zones. Its development portfolio comprises residential projects under the Mahindra Happinest brand name; integrates cities and industrial clusters under the Mahindra World City and Origins by Mahindra brand names. The company was formerly known as Mahindra Gesco Developers Ltd. and changed its name to Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited in October 2007. Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited was founded in 1994 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India. Mahindra Lifespace Developers Limited is a subsidiary of Mahindra & Mahindra Limited.",
